GVDataSet Name=CWMS88_HMS
Description=Copy of CMWS NAVD88 network with added junctions and local flows set up for HMS forecast.  Routing data supplied from HEC-RAS models.  Flood zones are the rules from the FIS ResSim model and the conservation/buffer zones rules are from the IRRMBaseline ResSIm model. (Global Variable Data Set)


